  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A nucleus of mass <math><mi>M</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&Delta;</mi><mi>m</mi></math> is at rest and decays into two daughter nuclei of equal mass <math><mfrac><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> each. Speed of light is c.<br />\r<br />\rThe speed of daughter nuclei is</p>\r",
    "image": null
  },
